+# Original directory restoration after the normal G1 prefix
+
+This private continuation follows the same fifteen common Navigation actions.
+It owns one actual cleanup phase and its normal G1 Open, Login Entry, directory
+field focus/replace/Return, Home ray and Close. It writes no product setting,
+pose, camera or rating through a private setter. Whole-feature capability,
+independent changed-scene evidence and final resource/Host retirement remain
+separate obligations.
+
+## Restart authority and actual setting type
+
+The normal `LinkAccountBody.qml` Return handler stores the server field's
+QString text. It cannot restore absence or preserve an originally stored QUrl
+QVariant type. Native environment v2 admission therefore requires an explicit
+QString selection before the first ordinary mutation. The original v1/v2
+readers and default v2 writer remain available; historical packets are not
+retyped or rewritten. The host producer now reports its actual modeled type
+and a digest of its actual current selection/type before G0 acquisition.
+
+`NavigationOriginRestart` binds the original G0 Origin and environment archive
+to their actual bytes/full physical signatures and the immutable observed
+restart. A new independent bracket proves old-PID absence, the same actual G1
+native birth/lifecycle, current installed binding and Session, anonymous
+account, persisted original owned setting and unchanged unrelated preferences.
+The account generation/events must still agree with the actual completed G1
+prefix. The durable handoff is aged after its CAS. It never reuses a historical
+packet as a current observation.
+
+Origin v3 separates the exact old restore target from its fresh G1 Login-page
+baseline. All ordinary continuation predicates within G1 retain the original
+same-PID/bridge, sequence, clock and account requirements. Only the explicit
+typed handoff crosses the old/new process boundary. A v3 file cannot be read
+as a normal v2 input owner without that authority. G1 environment archives use
+the restoration prefix; the frozen G0 environment namespace remains unchanged.
+The additive private records are `navigationOriginVersion=3`,
+`navigationOriginRestartVersion=1`, `navigationOriginRestartReferenceVersion=1`
+and `navigationGenerationRestorationVersion=1`. Existing completed generation
+and continuation formats retain their versions and original bytes.
+
+## Inputs, originals and failure ownership
+
+`navigation_generation.compose` attaches the private restoration factory to
+the existing continuation/flow. It does not advertise a public cleanup triple.
+Actor roles cannot issue restoration input. The phase owner records exact Qt
+commands and independent controller envelopes before publication. Its final
+Qt writer guard rereads the original phase and parent physical identity after
+the command CAS. Controller intent/publication callbacks use only the retained
+host/native phase anchor, private host records and bounded original age while
+the Session mutex is held.
+
+Actual field/root effects establish completion; delivery acknowledgements do
+not. A lost applied Return may finish from the same pending scope without
+another Qt gesture. New packets retain their actual PID, bridge and clocks.
+The original replacement command must also be cleared and read back empty;
+the native hook's identity-less empty packet performs no input.
+
+Native environment transport text is retained before parsing. Each final
+quiet acquisition has a durable reading intent and retains returned original
+packets before semantic acceptance. An interrupted acquisition stays reading
+and cannot be adopted by a cold owner. Existing Origin archive/query grammar
+continues to distinguish environment packet IDs from the two actual Home
+observation IDs; both Home originals remain in the typed Origin body.
+
+After normal Home and Close, independent current sources must agree on the
+exact old selected/effective/auth URL and original raw Settings hash/type,
+unchanged maturity/foreign preferences and bookmarks, original grounded pose,
+dead Places/modal roots, hidden tablet/keyboard and neutral input. Both host
+and native clocks must advance for at least three seconds. Final publication
+uses the actual last source anchor across the real outer lock exit; it adds no
+new frame and never refreshes an old source timestamp. All original G0 files
+and completed G1 parent/Close files remain unchanged.
+
+## Reused architecture and limits
+
+The read-only Phone reference is fixed at
+`5e8ff8aa19571f5718b982dc47a165b8f22e0dc0`. Its Navigation coordinator's explicit
+role journals, immutable source references, original-value restoration and
+archive-before-CAS finalization informed this join. Phone W3C/touch classes,
+monoscopic image policy and optional holdView camera lease were not imported.
+The common v16 Navigation recipe was not migrated to v18.
+
+Three disjoint repository wrappers select all eight owning cases and one static
+selector inventory check exactly once:
+
+- `test_navigation_generation_restoration`: four cases, **99.966 seconds**,
+  198 loaded source hashes/full physical signatures unchanged. The actual
+  fifteen preceding actions and normal restoration/quiet path complete, repeat
+  without more input, and absent/QUrl originals refuse before mutation.
+- `test_navigation_generation_restoration_recovery`: one case,
+  **102.199 seconds**, 197 loaded sources unchanged. An applied lost Return
+  finishes after cold reconstruction without repeating Qt/controller input.
+- `test_navigation_generation_restoration_ownership`: four cases,
+  **102.219 seconds**, 197 loaded sources unchanged. Current old-PID,
+  after-command-CAS phase, retained-source and single-reader ownership guards
+  refuse unsafe continuation without extra input or cold source adoption.
+
+Each wrapper retains the original **120-second** outer limit. The owning cases
+need Python, Pillow and OpenSSL for their controlled loopback TLS fixture;
+they invoke no Node or compiler. The separate unchanged Origin/environment
+regression group passed all **27 cases** in **13.298 seconds**, with 163 loaded
+sources unchanged; its existing probe source test uses Node. Earlier failed
+command-clear/evidence/reader joins remain failed and retained at their actual
+source revisions. Private run records preserve their original files and logs.
+
+Host Qt, native Settings/QMetaType/serialization, AccountManager, OpenXR, OS,
+SDK and GPU remain explicit models. Real Python ownership/protocol code,
+controlled loopback TLS, private files, hashes, physical guards and journals
+execute. No build, compiler, headset, external account operation or native
+renderer/device qualification is claimed.
